{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"世間はお盆休みに\n突入したようですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にはお盆休みはありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、\nパリへ行ったから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます。\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天inパリ！公開中です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2週に渡って\nお送りしているパリ編ですが、\n次回、JAPAN EXPOのレポートで\n最終回です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、ご覧ください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\nまだブログに書いてなかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリの街並みは言葉では\n表せない程"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵で刺激的でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして9枚目の制服が\nパリに合うこと合うこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もはやパリのために\n作ったんじゃないか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思わせる程、\n青と白の制服が溶け込んでました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凱旋門っっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天クイズのおかげ様様で、\nいろんなところに行かせて\n頂いたんだけど、\nどれも本当に感動T^T♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ネタバレしてしまうので、\n詳しくはのぎ天見てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベルサイユ宮殿や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マルシェも行けて\n充実したパリ滞在になりました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教科書だけの世界だった\nフランスが目の前にあるなんて\n幸せこの上なかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか憧れの国へ\nお仕事で行かせて貰えるなんて\n思ってなかったから、\n感激でした(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学の友達と卒業旅行へ\n行けなかったから神様からの\nプレゼントかな(T_T)？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったら、\nいろんな国へ行きたいなあ（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nお返事TIME パリ編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分用のお土産は何買った？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんあるけど、\n無我夢中で買ったのは\n大好きなチョコレート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FAUCHON\nMONBANA\nMAXIM's DE PARIS"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は、もちろん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスのじゃないけど\nLindtのチョコレートも買いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的にはほとんど板チョコを\n購入したんだ～(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はボンボンショコラを\n買いたかったけど高かったからさ、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お金貯めてネットで\n買おうかな（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他には化粧品とかも\nもろもろ買いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリでは何食べたの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バケット\nジェラート\nクレープ\nクロワッサン\nチョコ\nマカロン\nオムレツ\nチーズ\nプロシュート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど挙げたらキリがないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的にバターや小麦粉食品が\n多いので、滞在中は\nずっと胃もたれしてました(←BBA...?)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっさりしたのが食べたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュリンプサラダとか頼んでも\nほぼエビ←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のサラダ頼んでも\nほぼプロシュート←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じで、\n中々あっさり食品に出会えなかった←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもパリのご飯は\n美味しかったので、\nいろんなもの食べられて大満足でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\nベストオブパリ飯はこちら！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハムとチーズが挟まった\nバケット！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に美味しかった(T_T)\nお店の名前わかんないけど、\nまた食べたいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本とフランスの違いで\n驚いたことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湿気が少ないこと！\n凄い暑くても\n過ごしやすかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\nレストランやカフェは\n必ずといって良い程、\nテラス席があることかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスの方々は\nテラス席でご飯食べてるのも\n絵になってたから凄い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"混雑度も\n店内席＜テラス席"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで\nフランス人ってテラス席\n好きなのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて思ったりしてました(^_^)v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか長々と質問に\n答えてみましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう文化の違いとかも\n学べて楽しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかパリ一色なブログですが、\n許してね！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/12/1334838/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメント\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真剣に書いてくれている\n文字を見ていると\n元気が出るし、本当に救われます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目もよろしくお願いします。"}],"source":"archive"}